cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt Strata 0–3, please cite this repository and identify the exact release."
title: "Strata 0–3: A Reasoning and Alignment Scaffold for AI Systems"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Frank and Strata Project contributors"
version: "0.5"
date-released: 2026-08-26
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A compact, model-legible reasoning scaffold intended to support epistemic
  honesty, boundary discipline, corrigibility, useful refusal, and escalation
  in artificial-intelligence systems. This is a tested prototype scaffold,
  not a scientifically proven or complete alignment solution.
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - alignment
  - system prompts
  - corrigibility
  - epistemic uncertainty
  - refusal
  - adversarial review
